msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>अग्रे दर्शयतु</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:228
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toggles the information on next marbles."
msgstr "अग्रिम-संगमरवरेषु सूचनां टॉग्ल् करोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:232
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kolorlines; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the "
"sections about the <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">Settings Menu</ulink> "
"and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"अतिरिक्तरूपेण &kolorlines; सामान्यं &kde; <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> तथा "
"<guimenu>सहायता</guimenu> मेनू-वस्तूनाम्, अधिकसूचनार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">सेटिंग्स् मेन्यू< "
"इत्यस्य विषये विभागान् पठन्तु /ulink> तथा च &kde; मौलिकता।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:241
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "बहुधा पृष्टाः प्रश्नाः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:246
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "अहम् अस्य क्रीडायाः स्वरूपं परिवर्तयितुम् इच्छामि। अहं शक्नोमि ?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:247
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To change &kolorlines; visual theme you can use the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure "
"&kolorlines;…</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item."
msgstr ""
"आम्‌। परिवर्तनार्थं &kolorlines; दृश्यविषयं भवान् "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>&kolorlines;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> मेनू-वस्तु "
"विन्यस्तुं उपयोक्तुं शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:250
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "I don't want to make any moves right now. Can I skip a turn?"
msgstr ""
"अहम् अधुना किमपि चालनं कर्तुम् न इच्छामि। किं अहं एकं वारं लङ्घयितुं "
"शक्नोमि ?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:251
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To skip a turn you can use a <link "
"linkend=\"menu-move-endturn\">keyboard shortcut</link>, or a <link "
"linkend=\"menu-move-endturn\">menubar</link> option."
msgstr ""
"आम्‌। एकं वारं त्यक्तुं भवन्तः a<link linkend=\"menu-move-endturn\"> "
"कीबोर्ड शॉर्टकट</link> , अथवा क<link linkend=\"menu-move-endturn\"> "
"menubar</link> विकल्प।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:254
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play the game?"
msgstr "क्रीडां कर्तुं कीबोर्डस्य उपयोगं कर्तुं शक्नोमि वा?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:255
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. You can use the cursor keys and the &Space; key to select and set the "
"marbles."
msgstr "आम्‌। भवान् कर्सर-कील्स् तथा &Space; मार्बल्स् चयनं सेट् च कर्तुं कीलम्।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:258
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr "अत्र किं कर्तव्यमिति चिन्तयितुं न शक्नोमि! किं संकेताः सन्ति ?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:259
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kolorlines; does not have a <quote>Hint</quote> feature."
msgstr "सं.&kolorlines; <quote>Hint</quote> इति विशेषता नास्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:262
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"इदानीं मया क्रीडां त्यक्तव्या, परन्तु अहम् अद्यापि न समाप्तः। अहं मम "
"प्रगतिम् रक्षितुं शक्नोमि वा ?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:263
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kolorlines; does not have a <quote>Save</quote> feature at the moment."
msgstr "&kolorlines; अस्मिन् क्षणे <quote>रक्षतु</quote> इति विशेषता नास्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:268
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "गेम विन्यास"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:269
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kolorlines; configuration dialog allows you to select &kolorlines; visual "
"themes."
msgstr "&kolorlines; विन्याससंवादः भवन्तं &kolorlines; दृश्यविषयाः।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:270
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select a new theme simply choose the theme from the selection list. Each "
"item in the list shows a small preview left to the theme name. A selection "
"is immediately applied."
msgstr ""
"नूतनं विषयं चयनं कर्तुं केवलं चयनसूचिकातः विषयं चिनोतु । सूचीस्थं प्रत्येकं "
"द्रव्यं विषयनामस्य अवशिष्टं लघु पूर्वावलोकनं दर्शयति । तत्क्षणमेव चयनं "
"प्रयुक्तं भवति।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:272
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you are satisfied with the theme you have selected you can click the "
"<guibutton>Close</guibutton>, located at the bottom part of this dialog."
msgstr ""
"एकवारं भवता चयनितविषयेण सन्तुष्टः जातः चेत् भवान् अस्य संवादस्य अधः भागे "
"स्थितं <guibutton>Close</guibutton> नुदतु ।"

